<title>SINGAPORE: YHS to distribute Danone non-dairy food.</title>
<headline>YHS to distribute Danone non-dairy food.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yeo Hiap Seng Ltd (YHS) said in a statement on Wednesday it has been appointed exclusive distributor in Singapore for French food group Danone's range of non-dairy products.</p>
<p>YHS said the new brands it will distribute are mainly food products and include such brand names as Lea &amp; Perrins and HP Sauces. The distribution agreement takes effect from December 1 this year.</p>
<p>The company added that it would be establishing a new food division to market and distribute both its own and Danone's brands in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3046</p>
</text>
